  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mrow>&#160;</mrow></math><math><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Li</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mo>-</mo> </msubsup> <mo>&#60;</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>Li</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msubsup> <mo>&#60;</mo> <msub> <mtext>Li</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br />Bond order <math> <mo>&#8733;</mo> </math> stability of species<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;both have same bond order, but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;has more number of electron in anti-bonding molecular orbitals (experience more inter electronic repulsion) and hence least stable among three species."
